# Trained model artifacts and scraped payloads, at the repository root only.
#
# These were written as bare `models/` and `data/raw/`, which git matches at
# every depth. That silently excluded src/biryar/db/models — the tenancy and
# credential models — from the repository entirely. The leading slash anchors
# them to the root, where those artifacts actually live.
/models/
/data/raw/

.DS_Store
